  "description": "The anonymously known genius photographer, Spacey, has never revealed her face, but her photos have always captivated the world. Influencer Kang In-Young, who has always been the subject of gossip due to her scandalous private life, has actually been a longtime admirer of hers. In-Young, who enjoys one-night stands, ends up spending the night with a woman on this cruise as well. She thought it would just be a passing one-night stand... but it turns out it was Spacey?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
